    "design": "Implement the published arithmetic separately in Node.js without the Python verifier or app modules. Derive operating points from nine genuine groups and match published outcomes for all four arms in both held panels and all exact paragraph-break batches. Independently verify exact bytes and Unicode input ranges plus before/after odds direction for the four actual ordinary-route JSON exports when local draft files are available. Reject changes to a decision, native input, source range and actual draft bytes. Use a fixed arithmetic tolerance of 4e-15 for published log-odds points only. Preserve no claim of model inference, new accuracy or independent human review.",
